Graphics Environment Manager (GEM)

Historical origin
-----------------
GEM did not originate with this repository. The original Graphics Environment
Manager was developed by Digital Research with Lee Jay Lorenzen and first
released on February 28, 1985. Gary Kildall oversaw its creation at Digital
Research. Dorothy McEwen Kildall co-founded Digital Research and managed the
company's marketing and daily operations.

This separate modern application is not the original Digital Research GEM
desktop and contains no original Digital Research GEM source code. Historical
acknowledgment does not imply affiliation with or endorsement by Digital
Research or the Kildall family.

