Modern code origin
------------------
This repository is derived from the GEM native workbench and METRIX terminal
components in Ablation (https://github.com/Ablation-Tool/ablation), particularly
gem-lab/gem and gem-lab/metrix. The split dashboard/agent design, append-only
session protocol, native terminal implementation, and drag-and-drop handling
were adapted for a standalone, project-neutral template.

The original Ablation project is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. This
derivative repository retains that license; see LICENSE.

The terminal emulator uses pyte (MIT) and optionally tkinterdnd2 (MIT) and
pywinpty (MIT). Those packages retain their own licenses.

The terminal's named ANSI color arrangements include conventional Tango, Linux
console, and XTerm colors. No Ablation analysis engine, model, credentials, or
AI provider code is included.
